<title>USA: Terex says completes sale of Clark unit.</title>
<headline>Terex says completes sale of Clark unit.</headline>
<dateline>WESTPORT, Conn. 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Terex Corp said Friday it has completed the sale of its Clark Material Handling Co for $139.5 million in cash to  CMHC Acquisition Corp.</p>
<p>Proceeds from the sale are to be used to retire debt, Terex said.</p>
<p>Terex manufactures off-road trucks, mobile cranes and aerial work platforms.</p>
